-#       enough room for a 3-row hollow sprite.
-#   observability:
-#     - Humans can infer the rule from shape change alone: whichever side contains the palette loses exactly 2 rows/cols.
-#     - The fill behavior is still supported by repeated border->fill examples, so the crop does not replace the original rule.
-#   cleanliness_and_color_inference:
